        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "The Ursus assholes are hiding amongst the Infected and the mercenaries! They are disguised as Reunion! Keep an eye out!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Unless you see paint somewhere on their body, don't let a single one of them get away! If they even dare to take a step inside, kill them on the spot!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "The Reunion folks are only here because they were talked into this mess! Do we really have to kill them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Save that question for yourself. We'll see what you think in a few minutes when you find yourself getting stabbed in the back!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_090"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Guard, the enemy's putting up way too much of a fight! Reunion isn't supposed to have this kind of firepower!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Then what kind of firepower are they supposed to have?!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If we were able to give all of our mortar gunners the newest weapons, we probably could've taken the city down directly without the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "They don't care about covering their tracks anymore! They're trying to rush inside at all costs!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "If that's the case, why didn't Talulah keep them close to her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Because she's afraid! She's afraid we'd see through their identities and their plans!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_090"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Not even she would be able to cover everything up if there were too many people. Besides, those aren't the kind of weapons you can just pick up and take around."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "They probably had all those weapons stashed across the core city long ago just for times like these when everything falls apart!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "They were designed to deal with us from the start! They want to kill all of us. But they're wrong! We will be the ones doing the killing today, not them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Hold the line! Forward!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_090"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "What are you doing?! You want to... leave the battlefront?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Rhodes Island, take a better look!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "We are the battlefront! Wherever we are, that's where the battlefront is! Forward!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "That isn't going to work! Our teams can't keep up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "We'll hold the line and find an opportunity to take them out. Then you'll keep up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Phantom Crossbowmen, can you do this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "We don't really have much of an advantage without the captain."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "But you can do it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Captain Faust was willing to throw his life away for the rest of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...If Rhodes Island's rabbit can really help us get revenge for him, we're more than willing to put our lives on the line!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You don't need to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "You're... from Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I just need to bomb their position directly, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Raidian, if you are reading this, help me jam their signals."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I just need their headphones to blow up for a moment. Yep, just the sound, not an actual explosion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You can blow their ears up too if you want."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Okay, in five seconds?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Four seconds, Phantom Crossbowmen. Get ready."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Three. Guard, have your team break up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...I'll trust you this once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Shieldguards, take your shields down."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You'll be out in the open!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "But, the guerrillas..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "One."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If someone's willing to put their life on the line for us, then we'll put our lives on the line for her too!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Look, all the bastards pretending to be Reunion passed out all of a sudden!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Three."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a question that Guard has asked himself many, many times. He finds himself wondering this once again."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are many operators in Rhodes Island with astounding powers, and, with those powers, they can easily influence the outcome of the battle. How should he look upon these formidable allies?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once, he got an answer from Ace. He got another answer from Scout. And now he found yet another answer in Rosmontis."
    },
    {
        "text": "As her massive swords begin to bear down on the enemy's artillery, and as the Sarkaz mercenaries begin to raise the crossbows in their hands, Guard can't help but yell out of his lungs:"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Shieldguards! Shields up! Protect Rosmontis!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Together, they are a squad. They need to be protected, they need cooperation, and they need understanding."
    },
    {
        "text": "They are people. People who are fighting gallantly, just like him."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
