        "text": "Got them! You've got pretty sharp eyes, kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Thanks, Guard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Don't thank me. Just keep doing what you're doing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "All Shieldguards, squad members, and Infected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "And my friend... my family..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "We will make it home. We will defeat them, and Amiya will defeat Talulah. Then, we'll all go home, together."
    },
