    {
        "text": "Where am I?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should go back."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a little cold..."
    },
    {
        "text": "What's up with those black shadows?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0.5,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I remember now. They were freezing to death, so I gave them something."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... It's cold here."
    },
    {
        "text": "What did I give them?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't remember. I think it was something important. I think someone might've told me to never give it to anyone else."
    },
    {
        "text": "But then... why did I give it away to them?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it not important to me? Probably not. If it gets too cold, I would probably disappear too."
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know why."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's because that's what my friends would do."
    },
    {
        "text": "My friends..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "There was a guy who was really strict. I wonder if he saw me as a friend."
    },
    {
        "text": "There was someone who sang to me. It's been a long time since I heard her sing."
    },
    {
        "text": "There was someone who looked really scary. But she makes really good food."
    },
    {
        "text": "There was a girl. She was the dearest to me. She was the one who told me where I could go. But... I don't understand. I really don't understand."
    },
    {
        "text": "There was also someone who rarely talked at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0.5,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Something is coming."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are lots of black shadows."
    },
    {
        "text": "What are they doing?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do they want my life too?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Life."
    },
    {
        "text": "Life... is precious."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is life useful at all?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The black shadows are getting really close."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are they here to take my life away?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
