    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Take a step back, Doctor. Don't get any closer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We got here too late."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "image": "avg_8_20",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 150,
            "xscale": 1.5,
            "yscale": 1.5,
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "imagetween",
        "params": {
            "yfrom": 150,
            "y": 50,
            "xscale": 1.5,
            "yscale": 1.5,
            "duration": 25,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "That is an Infected no longer."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's something else."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...Poor fellow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Even I have only seen a case like this just once."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The caster and the victims were fused together. Their bodies and Originium formed a mountain, and from it bloomed a kind of really fragile flower."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The dust spread in the wind, and whoever that traveled through that cursed place found themselves infected\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014Not only that, but anyone who was unfortunate enough became new hosts and ended up spreading the suffering and death."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "It doesn't sound like you're just talking about the past.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Rhetorics would merely be insults to this tragedy. Everything that I say is the truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The source of the infection was as lively as poison. Its effect on life doesn't stop naturally."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "At the time, I swore to myself that I would keep something like that from ever happening again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Yet things rarely turn out the way you want them. I've come to notice that these things will just keep happening over and over right before my eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "(Low moans)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...It seems like it's fallen into a deep sleep. It's just venting unconsciously."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That Sarkaz herd was probably not under its control only because it wasn't trying to control them in the first place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Freedom."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It's ironic. To think that a herd could be free."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "(Humming)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I knew it. This is the culprit of the Originium dust superspreader event."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "This isn't good. If this is how all the Sarkaz herd are going to turn out, the losses will be beyond measure."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Its dust isn't just some simple Originium Arts anymore. It might even infect normal people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It wasn't pretty, the Originium clusters blooming across the cities. If I can help it, I don't want to see anything like that ever again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}. We need to subdue that thing first. Stop the herd from growing, and prevent the infection from spreading."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
