        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You know what that is?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Yeah.;Can't say for sure.;No.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Doctor, I don't know what's going on in your mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, I'm a doctor, not a judge."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "This world is suffering from a disease. If no one treats it, what do you think will happen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Of course, living things usually have immune systems, and suppose the world does as well, it might be able to recover from the disease on its own..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But we can't live in an even more barren world. That will only cause it to weaken, and we will die because of that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "As for the Infected before us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "(Hissing sounds)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Let me get this out of the way. Even if a disease is seen as untreatable, to us doctors, death is far from a foregone conclusion."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "'Until an effective cure is found, the patient's life is under serious threat.' That's how we see it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "There is one thing that a doctor will never believe\u2014even if it's what the whole world believes\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "'The disease is untreatable.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That's an excuse. And one that should never be used by us doctors."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It doesn't matter what kind of predicaments we find ourselves in. I will never use my medical knowledge in any manner that can be concerned inhumane. From the moment all life is born, they all possess dignity."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "No matter how society at large sees them, treating patients with Oripathy will always be my calling."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "That is why I will never give up on life, especially those that can be cured."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Yet we as doctors will never deny that there are precautions that must be undertaken to prevent diseases from reaching even more people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The Infected cannot become the tools of others. No one may control other lives."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...If I don't do anything at all, that will become a goal, a weapon, an excuse. If we leave it be, then we won't be able to take our revenge against Ursus."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "On the contrary, Ursus's wounds will become the wounds of others."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We cannot leave a struggle of pain simply be."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "There are some diseases that normal medical personnel cannot cure."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "All the things that the world imposed on them will only rain down on others several times over every now and then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014That's about everything a doctor can do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If we are to save even more lives..."
    },
