        "text": "Which is why, our goal is without a doubt undeniable."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, we need to halt the Core City's power supply, but before that, to prevent another Catastrophe from happening, we need to take care of the herd that's growing in numbers by the minute."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Mon3tr, arise!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...We don't have much time left. With how it turned out... we can't even say we are delivering anyone from harm. The Sarkaz herd's fate is sealed."
